ghost-role-information-space-leviathan-name = Space Leviathan
ghost-role-information-space-leviathan-description = A colossal predator roaming the empty reaches of space.
ghost-role-information-space-leviathan-rules =
    You are a [color=#ff8227][bold]space leviathan[/bold][/color]. You are free to kill and destroy anyone except allied forces. You are a true cosmic predator.
    Your [color=green]allies[/color] are other [color=#ff8227]leviathans[/color]. [color=red][bold]YOU ARE STRICTLY FORBIDDEN FROM APPROACHING STATIONS OR THEIR SPHERES OF INFLUENCE, OR FROM DESTROYING THEM.[/bold][/color]
    You do not remember your previous life or anything learned while you were a ghost.
